# port/gfx/s1-session.script — deterministic S1 live-session input script
# (M3 task 5; played by port/tools/fk_input.c on the FunKey-S).
#
# Letter keysyms (CLAUDE.md "Device access" / platform_sdl1.c):
#   u/d/l/r = d-pad   a/b/x/y = face (y = S1 C-layer)   m = L (Mod)
#   (L moved k -> m on 2026-08-24: the physical L shoulder emits KEY_M,
#    measured off /dev/input/event0 — fix_plan A25b + A3. The session is
#    UNCHANGED in what it presses; only the keysym that reaches it is.)
#   n = R (shield)    s START is EXCLUDED on purpose (pause is main.js
#   browser plane, outside the sim's captured domain; start->s mapping
#   is proven by the s1_sweep unit harness).
#
# Session: 900 frames @ 60 fps = 15.0 s, seed 1337 fox vs marth on
# battlefield. The injector is launched only AFTER the app's ready
# marker exists; the opening sleep clears the 90-frame `starting`
# window. Every chord is held 250-300 ms (15-18 frames) — >= 10x the
# one-frame sampling jitter (pre-registered settling strategy): the
# recorded trace is judged on VALUES, never frame indices.
#
# Coverage plan (the judge asserts every signature below appears):
# dash +-1.0 both signs, plain up/down, plain diagonal, R+up-diagonal,
# L-walk both signs, L-u/d-tilt, L-diagonal, L+R wavedash diag both
# signs, shield (r/rA=1), shield drop both signs, spotdodge, SOCD both
# pairs, C-layer cardinals (x and y axes, both signs on x) + diagonal,
# a/b/x button presses.

# clear boot margin + the starting window
s 2500

# --- dash right (cardinal +1.0) ---
d r
s 300
u r
s 60

# --- dash left, then f-smash left (cardinal -1.0 + A) ---
d l
s 250
d a
s 250
u a
u l
s 60

# --- L-walk right (0.6625) ---
d m
d r
s 300
u r
u m
s 60

# --- L-walk left (-0.6625) ---
d m
d l
s 250
u l
u m
s 60

# --- L u-tilt (0, 0.5375) with A ---
d m
d u
s 200
d a
s 200
u a
u u
u m
s 60

# --- L d-tilt (0, -0.5375) ---
d m
d d
s 250
u d
u m
s 60

# --- plain up (0, 1.0) — tapJumpOffp1 surface: no tap jump ---
d u
s 300
u u
s 60

# --- plain diagonal up-right (0.7, 0.7) ---
d u
d r
s 300
u u
u r
s 60

# --- jump then C-layer down (aerial c-stick) ---
d x
s 120
u x
d y
d d
s 300
u d
u y
s 60

# --- L-diagonal up-right (0.7375, 0.3125) ---
d m
d u
d r
s 300
u u
u r
u m
s 60

# --- shield alone (r=true rA=1.0) ---
d n
s 300

# --- shield drop right (0.7, -0.6875) [R still held] ---
d d
d r
s 300
u d
u r

# --- spotdodge (0, -1.0) [R still held] ---
d d
s 300
u d
u n
s 60

# --- jump, then L+R+down-left wavedash chord (-0.6375, -0.375) ---
d x
s 120
u x
d m
d n
d d
d l
s 300
u d
u l
u n
u m
s 60

# --- SOCD: left+right -> neutral ---
d l
d r
s 300
u l
u r
s 60

# --- SOCD: up+down -> neutral ---
d u
d d
s 300
u u
u d
s 60

# --- C-layer cardinals: right (csX 1.0), up (csY 1.0) ---
d y
d r
s 250
u r
d u
s 250
u u
u y
s 60

# --- C-layer diagonal down-left (-0.7, -0.7) ---
d y
d d
d l
s 250
u d
u l
u y
s 60

# --- neutral special (B) ---
d b
s 250
u b
s 60

# --- side special right (B + right) ---
d r
d b
s 250
u b
u r
s 60

# --- second pass: dash left / shield drop left / C-layer left ---
d l
s 250
u l
s 60

d n
d d
d l
s 250
u d
u l
u n
s 60

d y
d l
s 250
u l
u y
s 60

# --- R+up-diagonal (plain diagonal under shield, (0.7, 0.7)) ---
d n
d u
d r
s 250
u u
u r
u n
s 60

# --- L+R+down-right wavedash chord (0.6375, -0.375) ---
d m
d n
d d
d r
s 250
u d
u r
u n
u m
